; ============================================================================
; DNS zone file for hanhduywedding.online  →  GitHub Pages (user anhduy0911)
; Import this at your domain's DNS provider ("Import zone file" / BIND format).
; Most providers auto-manage SOA + NS records, so only the A/AAAA/CNAME below
; matter. If your provider requires an SOA line, uncomment the block near the top.
; ============================================================================

$ORIGIN hanhduywedding.online.
$TTL 3600

; --- Optional SOA (uncomment only if your provider needs one) ---------------
; @   IN SOA ns1.example.com. admin.hanhduywedding.online. (
;         2026083000 ; serial (YYYYMMDDnn)
;         3600       ; refresh
;         600        ; retry
;         604800     ; expire
;         3600 )     ; minimum TTL

; --- Apex (root) → GitHub Pages IPv4 ---------------------------------------
@       IN  A       185.199.108.153
@       IN  A       185.199.109.153
@       IN  A       185.199.110.153
@       IN  A       185.199.111.153

; --- Apex (root) → GitHub Pages IPv6 (optional but recommended) -------------
@       IN  AAAA    2606:50c0:8000::153
@       IN  AAAA    2606:50c0:8001::153
@       IN  AAAA    2606:50c0:8002::153
@       IN  AAAA    2606:50c0:8003::153

; --- www subdomain → your GitHub Pages site --------------------------------
www     IN  CNAME   anhduy0911.github.io.
